---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy — SB Fall Protection" description="How SB Fall Protection collects, uses and protects the information you share through its website.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    lead="How SB International handles the information you share with us through this website."
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]}
    image="about"
    compact
  />
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated 7 September 2026</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>SB International ("SB Fall Protection", "we") operates sbfallprotection.com. This policy explains what information we collect through the website, why we collect it, and how it is handled.</p>
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>When you send a quote request or enquiry we collect the details you enter: your name, company, email address, phone number, delivery country and the description of your requirement. We do not collect payment information through this website.</p>
        <p>The website itself does not set advertising or analytics cookies. Embedded content, such as the Google map on the contact page and Instagram clips on the home page, is served by those providers and may set their own cookies under their own policies.</p>
        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your enquiry and prepare a quotation.</li>
          <li>To follow up on an existing order or business relationship.</li>
          <li>To keep a record of enquiries for our sales team.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell or rent your information, and we do not use it for marketing you have not asked for.</p>
        <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
        <p>Enquiries are stored in a secure database hosted by Supabase and are accessible only to authorised SB staff. Notification emails are sent through our Microsoft 365 business email.</p>
        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>Enquiry records are kept for as long as they are useful to the business relationship, and are deleted on request.</p>
        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>You may ask us at any time to show you the information we hold about you, correct it, or delete it. Write to <a href="mailto:sales@sbfallprotection.com">sales@sbfallprotection.com</a> and we will respond within a reasonable period.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>SB International, Plot C-17 to C-19, UPSIDC Industrial Area, Textile Zone, Rooma, Kanpur 208008, Uttar Pradesh, India.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="legal-credit">This website was designed and developed by
        <a href="https://aijugaad.co/ig" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AI Jugaad</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
